{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqgztj9lza0","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Headless drain fire rate has no rate-limit backoff and an aggressive 5-min per-eager-node cadence; amplifies API overload","summary":"Operational finding (user flagged hitting CLI rate limits during an Anthropic 529 overload). The headless drains fire on a HARDCODED 5-minute setInterval (daemon.js ~L2205), no jitter, not configurable. Each tick runDueDrains spawns a learner claude -p (if a repo queue is pending), one judge claude -p per EAGER node plus one periodic judge, and the label node script; throttled ONLY by maxConcurrency=2 and maxIterations=50 PER DAEMON BOOT (cumulative module state, reset on every restart). Each judge/learner spawn is a full heavyweight Claude Code session. CRITICAL GAP: the governor has NO rate-limit/429/529 awareness — runDrain returns exitCode/stderr/spawnError but a throttled or overloaded spawn is never backed off; the next 5-min tick fires again regardless, so during an API overload the drains keep generating failing claude -p calls that waste quota and add load. Combined with a dispatcher session that spawned ~12 heavyweight Agent workers, the account fire rate is high. FIX (fold into the pluggable-backend + dashboard config, see note:note-mqgzmvnkaqy): (1) governor exponential backoff when a spawn signals rate-limit/overload (parse exit/stderr for 429/529/overloaded → skip N ticks, grow the interval, surface state); (2) make cadence/concurrency/judge-budget configurable (env + dashboard) with conservative defaults (e.g. 15-min interval, concurrency 1) + jitter; (3) cap eager-judge spawns PER TICK (not just per boot) so a task-creation burst doesn't fire many claude -p back-to-back. The 529s are primarily Anthropic server-side overload (not purely self-inflicted) but the no-backoff drains amplify it. Cannot apply live now — Bash is blocked by the same overload's safety-classifier; apply on recovery.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-16T18:46:14.217Z","vec":[-0.054076675325632095,0.013790550641715527,-0.0616883784532547,0.02228131890296936,0.026304202154278755,-0.043388478457927704,0.010731309652328491,0.026685528457164764,0.010205430909991264,0.05371023714542389,-0.022543426603078842,0.010472908616065979,0.01655345782637596,-0.0531318262219429,-0.005731637589633465,0.010011515580117702,0.10952608287334442,-0.08298367261886597,-0.06634563952684402,-0.0326242633163929,0.05771411210298538,-0.027011213824152946,0.009914801456034184,0.033019185066223145,-0.04816979914903641,-0.0512642078101635,-0.1185256838798523,-0.046197716146707535,-0.017434146255254745,-0.06295021623373032,0.023905275389552116,0.03523050621151924,-0.07450821995735168,-0.04810001328587532,-0.01966537907719612,0.0662558451294899,-0.035333145409822464,-0.0021999075543135405,-0.029560398310422897,0.03466044366359711,0.05680115893483162,0.06497644633054733,-0.06640210747718811,0.004308188799768686,-0.0036263579968363047,-0.044291503727436066,-0.05677211657166481,-0.04122607409954071,-0.07075567543506622,-0.03210250660777092,-0.004552118014544249,0.0031154584139585495,0.08654668927192688,0.014258980751037598,0.03958199545741081,0.03180982917547226,0.029378607869148254,0.02040106989443302,-0.050501689314842224,-0.014146152883768082,-0.09636186808347702,0.004475556779652834,-0.03246041387319565,-0.0043719117529690266,0.04971841350197792,0.01217957679182291,0.04061835631728172,-0.032824937254190445,0.04870721697807312,0.014959592372179031,0.02093428559601307,-0.005642548203468323,-0.05362718552350998,-0.0748591348528862,0.0196990929543972,0.032154109328985214,0.00013268113252706826,0.02870858460664749,0.01656775176525116,-0.13863295316696167,-0.05006701871752739,-0.034339308738708496,0.012902910821139812,-0.051373440772295,-0.006055756472051144,-0.02642786130309105,0.029814375564455986,-0.023368410766124725,0.08961477130651474,0.004647276364266872,0.03434563800692558,0.05322757735848427,0.008107190020382404,0.013424371369183064,0.04939120635390282